{"id":"65457a1980798fce","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-ramification.md","title":"Ramification","display":"df-ramification — Ramification","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ramification","aliases":["58-df-ramification"],"display":"df-ramification — Ramification","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-valuation.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ramification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ramification</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ramification — Ramification"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0fb569bc36cce327\" href=\"?note=0fb569bc36cce327\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-valuation.md\">../batch13/58-df-valuation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"699918fd54cc2a8e\" href=\"?note=699918fd54cc2a8e\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md\">../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,L,v,w,\\Gamma,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma\\in V\">\\(K,L,v,w,\\Gamma,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S:V^{10}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (extension first, base second; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"699918fd54cc2a8e\" href=\"?note=699918fd54cc2a8e\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md\">../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Valuation}_S\\subseteq V^9\\cup V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Valuation}_S\\subseteq V^9\\cup V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fb569bc36cce327\" href=\"?note=0fb569bc36cce327\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-valuation.md\">../batch13/58-df-valuation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e(w/v)\\in V\">\\(e(w/v)\\in V\\)</span> (ramification index defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtendsValuation}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{Ramified}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtendsValuation}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{Ramified}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ramification\\text{-}extension}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ExtendsValuation}_S(w,v,L,K,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\&amp;\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S(L,K,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Valuation}_S(v,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Valuation}_S(w,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L,\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)\\land w\\upharpoonright(K\\setminus\\{0_K\\})=v\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ramification\\text{-}extension}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ExtendsValuation}_S(w,v,L,K,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\&amp;\\mathrm{FieldExtensionStructure}_S(L,K,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Valuation}_S(v,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Valuation}_S(w,L,+_L,\\cdot_L,0_L,1_L,\\Gamma,+_\\Gamma,\\leq_\\Gamma)\\land w\\upharpoonright(K\\setminus\\{0_K\\})=v\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ramification\\text{-}index} \\vdash e(w/v)\\coloneqq[\\operatorname{ran}(w):\\operatorname{ran}(v)]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ramification\\text{-}index} \\vdash e(w/v)\\coloneqq[\\operatorname{ran}(w):\\operatorname{ran}(v)]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ramification\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ramified}_S(w,v,L,K,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ExtendsValuation}_S(w,v,L,K,\\Gamma)\\land e(w/v)&gt;1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ramification\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ramified}_S(w,v,L,K,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ExtendsValuation}_S(w,v,L,K,\\Gamma)\\land e(w/v)&gt;1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The index is taken only after the two value groups have been placed in the same ordered abelian group <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> has been required to extend <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A single existential block now supplies the field-extension and both valuation structures, so their operations and ordered value group cannot be chosen independently by three compatibility projections.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-valuation.md","s